<title>USA: Clinton wins California - CNN.</title>
<headline>Clinton wins California - CNN.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>President Bill Clinton has won California, the grand prize in U.S. presidential politics, according to projections made by the CNN television network on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Clinton had lavished time and energy on California, the nation's most populous state with 54 electoral college votes, making more than two dozen visits there since taking office. Earlier television projections showed Clinton had already locked up more than the 270 electoral votes needed to win.</p>
</text>
